================================================================================
Functional reference (architecture and inference/training pipeline)
================================================================================

- Retrieval-based Voice Conversion WebUI (RVC), MIT License.
  https://github.com/RVC-Project/Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI
  Resonantia reimplements RVC's inference/training pipeline design in C++/CUDA.
  RVC model class definitions were consulted as a numerical-alignment reference
  under tools/rvc_ref/ (not vendored into the source tree).

================================================================================
Model architectures and reference implementations (numerical alignment)
================================================================================

- HuBERT / ContentVec content encoder.
  Reference outputs generated with HuggingFace Transformers (Apache-2.0) for
  per-sample C++ alignment. https://github.com/huggingface/transformers

- RMVPE (Robust Model-based Vocal Pitch Estimation) F0 extractor.
  DeepUnet + BiGRU architecture, reimplemented in C++/CUDA.

- VITS / NSF-HiFiGAN synthesizer (RVC v2 variant), reimplemented in C++/CUDA.

- microsoft/WavLM-Base+ (planned content encoder).

Pretrained weights are converted to safetensors by the offline tools under
tools/ (uv-managed Python environment) and are not redistributed here.

